DESCRIPTION:Join us for The Nutcracker Tea—a magical\, family-friendly af
 ternoon designed to introduce young audiences to the wonder of the classic
 al ballet The Nutcracker.\nPerfect for preschool and elementary-aged child
 ren\, while welcoming guests of all ages\, this festive experience brings 
 the beloved story to life as it is read aloud and dancers from Lafayette B
 allet Theatre perform select variations from the full-length ballet. Young
  guests will have the special opportunity to meet favorite Nutcracker char
 acters—and even learn part of a variation themselves!\nThe afternoon inc
 ludes a festive tea with savory bites and holiday sweets\, hands-on crafts
 \, engaging activities\, and memorable photo opportunities with members of
  the cast.\n\nhttps://happeningnext.com/event/the-nutcracker-tea-eid3a0e83
